        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "六大隊ト壹中隊　士族ヲ以編制ス一中隊五十八名八中隊ヲ合テ一大隊ト定ム"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "六大隊と壹中隊。士族をもって編制す。一中隊五十八名、八中隊を合わせて一大隊と定む。"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Six battalions and one company. Composed of shizoku. One company is 58 men; eight companies combined are reckoned as one battalion. (The warichu note prints in two sub-columns; read the right sub-column first.)"
